### Fallback Formula (when models unavailable)

```python
base_score = (
    (salary_delay / 10) * 0.25 +
    (auto_debit_fail / 5) * 0.30 +
    (abs(savings_drawdown) / 100) * 0.25 +
    (utility_delay / 10) * 0.20
)
risk_score = min(0.99, max(0.01, base_score + random_noise))
```

